         <title>AstroDiffraction V1.0 STF preview update (macOS Apple Silicon)</title>
         <description>
            <p>Native PCL C++ Process for generating diffraction spikes. Requires PixInsight 1.9.5 and macOS 14 or later.</p>
            <p>STF preview now auto-stretches images without an active view STF. Installed under Process &gt; Convolution &gt; AstroDiffraction.</p>
         </description>
